From: Steven Lamb <100538383+stevedamnvan@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 10:30:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] telemetry: map Claw fans and Panther Lake GPU temp
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Read both MSI WMI tachometers through MangoHud’s system-fan row and enable that row in the extended GameScope preset. Keep Steam Deck fan behavior intact.

Integrated Xe has no DRM hwmon temperature node on Panther Lake. On the exact MS-1T91 device, use GT_MAX byte 127 from Intel PMT normal telemetry GUID 0x03086000 when the standard hwmon source is absent. The offset and signed 8-bit Celsius encoding come from Intel’s public PTL telemetry schema.
